      "raw": "<p>Apologies if this has been asked before.</p><p>Magnetic Pole Shift says:</p><p>&quot;At the start of the villain turn, discard the top H minus 2 cards...&quot;</p><p>Does this remove the Police Backup?</p><p>&quot;Whenever a villain card would have a player discard a card...&quot;</p><p>1) Is discarding from the top of the one&#39;s deck &quot;discarding&quot;? MPS uses the &quot;discard&quot; terminology, but we always thought discarding applied only to cards from your hand.</p><p>2) Is the player the one doing the discarding due to MPS? It doesn&#39;t say <strong>who </strong>or what discards the top H minus 2 card. Is it the MPS doing the discarding, or the decks&#39; owners?</p>",
