      "created_at": "2015-07-15T18:34:17.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>1. &nbsp;Yes, a discard is being forced by a villain card</p><p>2. &nbsp;The villain card is causing the discard. &nbsp;Even things like \"Consider the Price of Victory\" doesn't specify who is causing the discard. &nbsp;Police Backup only cares that a villain card caused a discard. &nbsp;</p>",
